# Testing

- Use pytest and pytest-asyncio. Tests set `DATABASE_URL` to `sqlite+aiosqlite:///./test_ros.db` before the app is imported.
- A schema change needs a model or migration test on a disposable database.
- Downgrade tests use a temporary file, never `ros_server.db`.
- Seed and import tests must pass when run twice.
- A skipped PostgreSQL test is not a PostgreSQL pass. Say that it was skipped and why.
- Run `python scripts/validate_agent_registry.py` after editing the task registry.

```powershell
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pytest tests -q --tb=line
```
